# K8s & Traefik Rules

## Cluster

- **Server:** Hetzner 178.156.223.196
- **Orchestrator:** K3s
- **Use:** `sudo k3s kubectl` (not plain `kubectl`)

## Namespaces

| Namespace         | Purpose                    |
|-------------------|----------------------------|
| `lb-automotive`   | Backend, frontend, Redis   |
| `gamebox-security`| Vault, Traefik, cloudflared|
| `vault-unseal`    | Unseal Vault (transit)     |

## Key Paths

- K8s manifests: `deployment/k8s/`
- Traefik config: `deployment/k8s/gamebox-security/traefik/`
- Twilio webhook URL: `https://twilio.kozytherocket.space/lb-automotive/api/twilio/webhook`

## Traefik v3 Notes

- Uses Gateway API (HTTPRoute), not Ingress
- Service port 80 → container 8000 for Traefik
- URLRewrite strips `/lb-automotive` before backend
- Middleware CRDs via ExtensionRef may not work; prefer native Gateway API filters

